# Built by tools/media.py from the capture folder — 372 films and 620 stills,
# about half a gigabyte. It is derived, it is reproducible in twenty minutes,
# and deploy.sh syncs it to the bucket from here rather than through the build:
#
#   python3 tools/media.py
#
# The captures it is made from live outside this repository; set
# BRASSPAWN_CAPTURES if they are not at ~/Desktop/BrassPawn.
media/

